  "label": "Disability-Based Discrimination",
  "description": "Ableism is the discrimination or social prejudice against people with disabilities. It often manifests as mocking or trivializing disabilities, which is exactly what this meme does by making a joke about diabetes, a condition affecting millions of people. The meme promotes ableist attitudes by portraying a medical condition as something to be laughed at rather than respected or taken seriously.",
